OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazil's left-wing President Lula is
OL,8,Felected for a fourth term, beating
OL,9,FFlavio Bolsonaro in a knife-edge vote
OL,11,FLula, 80, is about to address crowds in
OL,12,FSao Paulo - who is he?
OL,14,FRight-wing senator Bolsonaro - the son
OL,15,Fof imprisoned former president Jair
OL,16,FBolsonaro - won the first round earlier
OL,17,Fthis month
